# P16 on WSL GtkBackend: ported 2026-10-20 from actions/win/P16-force-update-winui.actions; the steps and pass condition are the Windows file's, quoted below. Positions from the AT-SPI dump under WSLg (x11), client coordinates, origin empty; a control named in a row's note was looked up by that name.
# P16(WSL):由 actions/win/P16-force-update-winui.actions 移植(2026-10-20),步驟與通過條件同下方 Windows 原文；座標取自 WSLg 下的 AT-SPI,為 client 座標。
# P16 on Windows, WinUIBackend: force the snap that #160 is defined by.
#
# #160 is that a split view lays out very incorrectly on the first render and
# then snaps to a correct layout as soon as any state changes. The app reports
# each pane's measured size, so the bug becomes two numbers that can be
# compared rather than an impression.
#
# Read the baseline capture FIRST. At launch on WinUIBackend it says
# `sidebar: 180 x 22` and `detail: 660 x 22` -- widths that look right and a
# height of 22 that cannot be, since the panes fill the window. This file
# presses "Force update" so the pair can be read again afterwards.
#
# The counter in the button label is what proves the click landed:
# "Force update (0)" becomes "(1)" and "(2)".
#
# P16 於 Windows、WinUIBackend：促使 #160 所定義的那次「跳正」發生。
#
# #160 是「分割視圖在第一次算繪時排版嚴重錯誤，之後只要有任何狀態改變就會跳成正確的排版」。
# 本 app 會回報每個窗格量到的尺寸，因此這個 bug 變成兩個可比對的數字，而非一種印象。
#
# 請**先**讀基準截圖。在 WinUIBackend 上啟動時它顯示 `sidebar: 180 x 22` 與 `detail: 660 x 22`
# ——寬度看起來合理，而高度 22 不可能正確，因為窗格是填滿視窗的。本檔按下「Force update」，
# 好讓這組數字在事後再讀一次。
#
# 按鈕標籤上的計數器就是「點擊命中」的證據：「Force update (0)」會變成「(1)」與「(2)」。
#
# Measured on a 916x639 window capture at 100% display scale.
# 量測自一張 916x639 的視窗截圖，顯示縮放 100%。
sleep,,,,,,1800000,let WinUI finish first paint before the first click,gtk
click,366,80,,left,,,Force update (0) -- the snap #160 is about,gtk
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,gtk
click,103,173,,left,,,Science in the sidebar List,gtk
sleep,,,,,,900000,,gtk
click,526,80,,left,,,Switch to 3 column -- the three-column case,gtk
sleep,,,,,,1500000,hold for the capture,gtk
